      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm \"receiving love\" though. it feels like i'm just stealing it from them. they waste so much time and energy on me that they could be using on something actually good. it feels like the most selfless thing i could ever do is just... stop being the problem. wouldn't that be the kindest way to love them?",
